    \resumeItem{Rolled out scalable and reliable backend services and APIs because the old request path was unreliable under load - REST/HTTP APIs got logging and debugging hooks.}
    \resumeItem{Implemented responsive, user-friendly frontend applications in Next.js with TypeScript and React components, so the UI stayed snappy and accessible; compiled 16 modules in under 13 seconds after tightening Lighthouse accessibility scores.}
    \resumeItem{Developed relational data modeling in PostgreSQL and wired the queries into REST/HTTP APIs, then paired with Vue.js components to reduce slow endpoint impact-cutting query runtime from 900 ms to 180 ms.}
